  "id": "fried-chicken-sandwich",
  "name": "Fried Chicken Sandwich",
  "subtitle": "Crisp chicken with pickles on toasted buns",
  "description": "Chicken breasts are brined with dill pickles, seasoned, coated, fried until crisp, and served on buttered buns.",
